# Subjective input schema (`wh_gold1.subjective_input`)

Mortgage capture screens read/write **`wh_gold1.subjective_input`** tables. Dimension lookups (`mort.dim_loan`, `mort.dim_status`) remain on **`wh_gold`** for status filters and stable `loan_key` / `investor_key` mapping.

**Do not** retarget Capital dashboard services, `ManagementSummaryService`, or `CapitalInvestorService` unless explicitly requested.

## LTV Validation

```sql
select c.parent_loan_code,
       a.loan_code child_loan_code,
       a.loan_description,
       a.loan_alias_name,
       d.investor_alias_name,
       b.security_value,
       a.exposure,
       a.ranking,
       a.loan_to_value,
       a.ai_comments,
       a.qr_slide_link
from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_relationship a
left join wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_master b on a.loan_alias_name = b.loan_alias_name
left join wh_gold1.shared.dim_loan c on a.loan_code = c.loan_code
left join wh_gold1.subjective_input.investor_alias_relationship d on c.investor_code = d.investor_code
```

| DB column | API field |
|-----------|-----------|
| `parent_loan_code` | `parentLoanId` |
| `loan_code` | `childLoanId` |
| `loan_to_value` | `ltv` |
| `ai_comments` | `aiCommentary` |

Writes update `loan_to_value` on `loan_alias_relationship`. Confirm stamps audit when `loan_to_value` is present (AI-extracted value accepted).

## Configuration

```json
"FabricWarehouse": {
  "Database": "wh_gold",
  "SubjectiveInputDatabase": "wh_gold1"
}
```

Use `FabricWarehouseTables.SubjectiveInput("table_name")` — never hard-code `wh_gold1`.

## Table → screen mapping

| Table | API / screen |
|-------|----------------|
| `investor_alias_master` | `InvestorAliasController` — Investor Alias CRUD |
| `loan_alias_master` | `LoanAliasController`, `LoanSecurityValueController` |
| `loan_alias_relationship` | `LoansController`, `OtherCostCapture`, `DefaultDateCapture`, `DefaultSubjectiveAnalytics` |
| `investor_alias_relationship` | `InvestorsController` — Investor Alias assignment |
| `loan_tax_details` | `TaxArrearsController` |
| `loan_alias_relationship` + `shared.dim_loan` | `LtvValidationController` |

## UI query reference (source of truth)

```sql
-- Investor Alias CRUD
select * from wh_gold1.subjective_input.investor_alias_master;

-- Loan Alias CRUD
select * from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_master;

-- Loan Alias assignment
select loan_code, loan_description from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_relationship;
select loan_alias_name from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_master;

-- Investor Alias assignment
select investor_code, investor_name from wh_gold1.subjective_input.investor_alias_relationship;
select investor_alias_name from wh_gold1.subjective_input.investor_alias_master;

-- Tax Arrears
select a.loan_code, b.loan_description, b.loan_alias_name, a.tax_memo_date, a.tax_year, a.tax_arrears, a.tax_notes
from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_tax_details a
inner join wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_relationship b on a.loan_code = b.loan_code;

-- Security Value
select a.loan_alias_name, b.collateral, a.security_value, a.units, a.net_acres, a.square_feet
from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_master a
left join (
  select loan_alias_name, sum(collateral) collateral
  from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_relationship
  group by loan_alias_name
) b on a.loan_alias_name = b.loan_alias_name;

-- Other cost / default date / default subjective
select * from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_relationship;
```

