## Shared helper

`SubjectiveInputSql` centralizes table names and `loan_code` → `loan_key` joins. Reuse it when adding new mortgage capture endpoints.

## Join pattern

```sql
from wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_relationship r
left join wh_gold1.subjective_input.loan_alias_master m
  on r.loan_alias_name = m.loan_alias_name
left join wh_gold.mort.dim_loan l
  on l.loan_code = r.loan_code and l.is_current = 1
```

Filter by alias id: `m.loan_alias_id in (@ids)`. Status filter: append `LoanStatusFilterParser` on `l`.
